  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1430 is titled Entering the River. Deep under a nameless desert, Fang Yuan finishes an immortal Gu formation in minutes; the formation stirs the water and opens a hole that lasts only a few breaths. He uses Ancient Year Beast Transformation, charges through as an ancient desolate beast, and the hole seals behind him.",
      "chapters": [
        1430
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "move_ancient_year_beast_transformation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He enters the river with his physical body for the first time. The River of Time is a secluded domain of heaven and earth that runs through past, present, and future.",
      "chapters": [
        1431
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_river_of_time"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court rank-eight time path Gu Immortal Lord Huang Shi dies in the River of Time fight while Fang Yuan watches through an image.",
      "chapters": [
        1434
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pursuit-and-exit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_huang_shi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Purple Mountain True Monarch had already named Fang Yuan leader of Shadow Sect during the giant dream realm battle.",
      "chapters": [
        1370
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pursuit-and-exit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_purple_mountain_true_monarch",
        "fac_shadow_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "His corpse is brought to the stone lotus island afterward. On the island, Spectral Soul’s will addresses him as that sect leader and hands down Spectral Soul’s soul path true inheritance, together with the other holdings gathered there. The Red Lotus true inheritance contents still held on that island are handed down as well, though the Red Lotus true meaning there had already been absorbed earlier by Spectral Soul.",
      "chapters": [
        1435
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pursuit-and-exit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_red_lotus_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The island is a Red Lotus arrangement that Spectral Soul Demon Venerable later remodeled.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pursuit-and-exit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s group leaves the River of Time by another Western Desert tributary held by Tang clan, while Heavenly Court forces still watch the Shadow Sect tributary he abandoned. By the time Fairy Zi Wei’s side is still waiting, his group has already been back in Western Desert for ten days.",
      "chapters": [
        1436
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pursuit-and-exit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_western_desert",
        "fac_tang_clan",
        "char_fairy_zi_wei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1454 is titled Commotion in Treasure Yellow Heaven. Fang Yuan sells year Gu there as a newcomer against Xie Bao Shu, Rong Xin, and Wang Ming Yue, and a price war follows as each side cuts prices again.",
      "chapters": [
        1454
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "year-gu-market",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_treasure_yellow_heaven",
        "gu_year_gu",
        "char_xie_bao_shu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The sale ends in Fang Yuan’s victory: the three sellers cannot match his volume and cost, and their year Gu become unsellable for a stretch afterward.",
      "chapters": [
        1456
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "year-gu-market",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1479 is titled Parallel Refining Spring Autumn Cicada. With Sixth Hair’s help he runs that refinement on Spring Autumn Cicada.",
      "chapters": [
        1479
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cicada-refinement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_sixth_hair",
        "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "By chapter 1480, rank six Spring Autumn Cicada finishes the parallel refinement and heaven’s will inside it is gone, so he holds full control of the Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1480
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cicada-refinement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1490 is titled Thieving Heaven’s Dream Realm. Tang Fang Ming brings him to that mountain-sized dream realm in Western Desert.",
      "chapters": [
        1490
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "western-desert-dream-realm",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_dream_realm",
        "char_tang_fang_ming"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The immortal Gu formation that conceals it is controlled by Tang Fang Ming; Fang Yuan explores the dream realm in person, leaving his body while Shadow Sect shares formation control with him.",
      "chapters": [
        1491
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "western-desert-dream-realm",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Divine Bean Palace, Fang clan fights Heavenly Lotus Sect’s first supreme elder Chen Yi over the rank eight Immortal Gu House that Genesis Lotus left in Western Desert.",
      "chapters": [
        1527
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "western-desert-immortal-gu-house",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_divine_bean_palace",
        "fac_fang_clan",
        "fac_heavenly_lotus_sect",
        "char_chen_yi",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The battle ends with Fang clan holding Divine Bean Palace, while Fang Yuan, acting as Suan Bu Jin, takes gains that include great thief Immortal Gu and Soul Beast Token and leaves Fang clan owing him heavy compensation.",
      "chapters": [
        1530
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "western-desert-immortal-gu-house",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_great_thief",
        "gu_soul_beast_token"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Feng Jiu Ge and other Central Continent Gu Immortals are transported into Northern Plains Lang Ya blessed land under a Heavenly Court killer move built around Fixed Immortal Travel.",
      "chapters": [
        1540
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blessed-land-intrusion",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "gu_fixed_immortal_travel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan presses Lang Ya land spirit for Long Hair Ancestor’s refinement path true meaning, which the land spirit finally agrees to give.",
      "chapters": [
        1552
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "land-spirit-pressure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "char_long_hair_ancestor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1560 is titled Refinement Path Quasi-Supreme. Fang Yuan absorbs that Long Hair true meaning and his refinement path attainment rises to quasi-supreme grandmaster in one step.",
      "chapters": [
        1560
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "attainment-peak",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_refinement",
        "sys_quasi_supreme"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1561 is titled View At The Peak; it completes that realization and closes the range.",
      "chapters": [
        1561
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "attainment-peak",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
